	"nodes":[
		{"id":"6b37f0ecdb33b04f","x":-236,"y":-68,"width":456,"height":188,"type":"text","text":"After the fall of Armount the Unhileg planned a invasion that lasted only 4 hours before the entire nation of Cilindrath was taken over by undead and the liches that command them. After taking over this nation the liches began to spread their corruption all over Wildfort eventually conquering it in its entirety."},
